# OSS Package Implementation Complete

This directory contains the Object Storage Service (OSS) client implementation for Go-Shop V2.

## Files Created:
- config.go - OSS configuration structure and validation
- client.go - MinIO client implementation with upload/download/delete operations
- init.go - Global client initialization and management
- utils.go - Helper utilities for image upload and file naming
- client_test.go - Unit tests for OSS functionality
- example_test.go - Example usage demonstrations
- README.md - Package documentation
- integration_example.md - Integration guide for the main application

## Dependencies Added:
- github.com/minio/minio-go/v7 - MinIO Go SDK

## Configuration Updated:
- config/config.go - Added OSSConfig structure
- config/config.yaml - Added OSS configuration section

## Test Coverage:
- All unit tests passing
- 27% code coverage (basic validation tests)

## Next Steps:
- Integrate OSS client in upload service (Task 12.1)
- Use in review service for image uploads (Task 10.3)
- Use in refund service for proof uploads (Task 8.3)
